network-manager-openvpn3 (0.6.0~alpha.4-1~dhcargo1) noble; urgency=medium

  * service: openvpn3 config name now derives from NM's connection.id
    (the user-facing name `nmcli connection up NAME` uses) instead of
    the static "nm-openvpn3-rust" placeholder, so `openvpn3
    sessions-list` shows the connection the user actually activated.
    A `vpn.data['connection-name']` override still takes precedence;
    the static string remains only as a last-resort fallback.

