network-manager-openvpn3 (0.6.0~alpha.2-1~dhcargo1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Security & correctness hardening sweep across all five crates
    (audit follow-up):
    - service: O_NONBLOCK on the profile open (FIFO can't stall the
      daemon); allow-list KEY_EXTRA_ROUTES so a crafted vpn.data can't
      inject openvpn directives past the security tail; serialize
      Connect; suppress spurious Failure on NM-initiated Disconnect.
    - properties: harden the export-side pinned-profile read
      (O_NOFOLLOW + size cap) to match import; NULL-check
      g_module_error()/dli_fname; wrap every extern "C" entrypoint in
      catch_unwind; fail closed on inline-blob writes when the secure
      cert dir is unavailable.
    - ovpn3-client: propagate UserInputQueueGetTypeGroup errors instead
      of masking auth failures as an empty queue.
    - editor/auth-dialog: catch_unwind at the FFI boundary; zeroize
      secret intermediates; O_NONBLOCK keyfile probe.

