network-manager-openvpn3 (0.6.0~alpha.1-1~dhcargo1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Experimental dh-cargo packaging: resolves Rust deps from the
    Ubuntu / Debian archive's `librust-*-dev` packages (no vendored
    cargo tarball).  Workspace Cargo.toml downgraded on this branch to
    match the GTK4 / libadwaita / glib / if-addrs versions noble ships.
  * Version suffix `~dhcargo1` keeps these .deb's distinguishable from
    the vendored layout's builds (`-1`) when both layouts produce
    output side-by-side; apt orders `-1~dhcargo1` strictly below `-1`.

